Grow it with us
---------------

These are requests, not licence conditions. They are how the project gets
better for everyone:

- Send your improvements back. A fix, a new data source, a better facade or a
  faster bake helps every map. Open a pull request, even a small or rough one:
  https://github.com/frandbf/Onward-generator/pulls
- Tell us what you build. Share your map, a video or a bug in the issues:
  https://github.com/frandbf/Onward-generator/issues
- Credit the project. In a map description, a video or a fork, a line such as
  "Made with onward-generator (github.com/frandbf/Onward-generator)" lets other
  people find it and join in.


